    <section class="home-faq-section" id="faq" aria-labelledby="home-faq-title">
      <p class="home-faq-eyebrow" data-i18n="home_faq_eyebrow">Got questions?</p>
      <h2 class="home-faq-title" id="home-faq-title" data-i18n="home_faq_title">Frequently asked questions</h2>
      <div class="home-faq-list">
        <details class="home-faq-item">
          <summary data-i18n="home_faq_q1">What makes Uniko Beauties different?</summary>
          <p data-i18n="home_faq_a1">We are built around certified organic ingredients, vegan and cruelty-free formulas, and plastic-neutral packaging — with one of the most accredited beauty ranges in the world.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="home-faq-item">
          <summary data-i18n="home_faq_q2">Who can use Uniko products?</summary>
          <p data-i18n="home_faq_a2">Our hair and body range is made for everyday routines. Some products suit the whole family; always check each product page for who it is for — for example Queeny Lotion is for women and not for use during pregnancy.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="home-faq-item">
          <summary data-i18n="home_faq_q3">What makes your ingredients special?</summary>
          <p data-i18n="home_faq_a3">We lead with botanicals such as aloe vera, shea butter, vitamin E, hibiscus, basil and essential oils — chosen to cleanse, nourish and care for hair and scalp without sulfates, silicones or parabens.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="home-faq-item">
          <summary data-i18n="home_faq_q4">Why do your certifications stand out?</summary>
          <p data-i18n="home_faq_a4">Look for organic (ACO / COSMOS), PETA animal-test-free, vegan, halal, reef-friendly and CleanHub marks across the site — the same badges you see in our certifications row.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="home-faq-item">
          <summary data-i18n="home_faq_q5">When will I notice results?</summary>
          <p data-i18n="home_faq_a5">Many people feel a softer, cleaner ritual from the first use. Overnight sprays and masks work while you sleep; use as directed on each product for the best result.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="home-faq-item">
          <summary data-i18n="home_faq_q6">Do you offer free shipping?</summary>
          <p data-i18n="home_faq_a6">Yes. Delivery is free on orders over €95, as shown in the bar at the top of the site.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

